{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 8,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 314.606,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that according to our record,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.663,
      "end": 6.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we know our record to be true,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.211,
      "end": 9.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, it was a just man who did keep the record\u2014",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.735,
      "end": 12.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he truly did many miracles in the name of Jesus;",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.98,
      "end": 17.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was not any man who could do a miracle in the name of Jesus",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.34,
      "end": 20.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save he were cleansed every whit from his iniquity\u2014",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.364,
      "end": 26.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass, if there was no mistake made by this man in the reckoning of our time,",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.56,
      "end": 29.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the thirty and third year had passed away;",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.794,
      "end": 34.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the people began to look with great earnestness for the sign",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 34.85,
      "end": 39.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been given by the prophet Samuel, the Lamanite,",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.302,
      "end": 45.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, for the time that there should be darkness for the space of three days over the face of the land.",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 46.159,
      "end": 51.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there began to be great doubtings and disputations among the people,",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 51.401,
      "end": 54.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding so many signs had been given.",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 54.914,
      "end": 58.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the thirty and fourth year,",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 58.577,
      "end": 62.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the first month, on the fourth day of the month, there arose a great storm,",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 62.983,
      "end": 66.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such an one as never had been known in all the land.",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 67.1,
      "end": 69.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was also a great and terrible tempest;",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 70.159,
      "end": 74.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was terrible thunder, insomuch that it did shake the whole earth",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 74.519,
      "end": 77.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as if it was about to divide asunder.",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 77.8,
      "end": 80.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were exceedingly sharp lightnings,",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 80.581,
      "end": 83.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as never had been known in all the land.",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 84.233,
      "end": 86.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the city of Zarahemla did take fire.",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 87.374,
      "end": 90.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the city of Moroni did sink into the depths of the sea,",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 91.13,
      "end": 93.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof were drowned.",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 94.271,
      "end": 97.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the earth was carried up upon the city of Moronihah,",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 97.98,
      "end": 101.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that in the place of the city there became a great mountain.",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 102.143,
      "end": 107.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was a great and terrible destruction in the land southward.",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 107.839,
      "end": 112.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, there was a more great and terrible destruction in the land northward;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 113.035,
      "end": 118.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the whole face of the land was changed, because of the tempest and the whirlwinds,",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 118.927,
      "end": 121.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the thunderings and the lightnings,",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 121.429,
      "end": 124.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the exceedingly great quaking of the whole earth;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 125.36,
      "end": 127.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the highways were broken up,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 127.63,
      "end": 129.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the level roads were spoiled,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 130.132,
      "end": 132.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many smooth places became rough.",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 133.413,
      "end": 136.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many great and notable cities were sunk,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 136.565,
      "end": 138.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many were burned,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 138.231,
      "end": 143.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many were shaken till the buildings thereof had fallen to the earth,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 143.984,
      "end": 146.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof were slain,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 146.44,
      "end": 148.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the places were left desolate.",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 149.396,
      "end": 152.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were some cities which remained;",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 152.223,
      "end": 155.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the damage thereof was exceedingly great,",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 155.422,
      "end": 157.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were many in them who were slain.",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 158.517,
      "end": 162.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were some who were carried away in the whirlwind;",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 162.412,
      "end": 164.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whither they went no man knoweth,",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 164.728,
      "end": 167.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save they know that they were carried away.",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 167.869,
      "end": 176.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus the face of the whole earth became deformed, because of the tempests, and the thunderings, and the lightnings, and the quaking of the earth.",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 176.722,
      "end": 179.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the rocks were rent in twain;",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 179.874,
      "end": 186.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were broken up upon the face of the whole earth, insomuch that they were found in broken fragments,",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 186.277,
      "end": 189.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in seams and in cracks, upon all the face of the land.",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 190.672,
      "end": 195.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the thunderings, and the lightnings, and the storm,",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 195.96,
      "end": 199.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the tempest, and the quakings of the earth did cease\u2014",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 199.391,
      "end": 202.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they did last for about the space of three hours;",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 202.868,
      "end": 205.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was said by some that the time was greater;",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 205.974,
      "end": 211.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, all these great and terrible things were done in about the space of three hours\u2014",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 211.541,
      "end": 214.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then behold, there was darkness upon the face of the land.",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 215.518,
      "end": 220.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was thick darkness upon all the face of the land,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 220.481,
      "end": 224.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the inhabitants thereof who had not fallen",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 224.33,
      "end": 226.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "could feel the vapor of darkness;",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 227.471,
      "end": 230.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there could be no light, because of the darkness,",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 230.53,
      "end": 232.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither candles, neither torches;",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 232.846,
      "end": 237.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither could there be fire kindled with their fine and exceedingly dry wood,",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 238.088,
      "end": 241.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so that there could not be any light at all;",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 242.112,
      "end": 244.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was not any light seen,",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 244.475,
      "end": 246.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither fire, nor glimmer,",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 246.42,
      "end": 249.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither the sun, nor the moon, nor the stars,",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 249.294,
      "end": 252.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for so great were the mists of darkness",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 252.214,
      "end": 254.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were upon the face of the land.",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 255.355,
      "end": 258.977,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that it did last for the space of three days",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 259.157,
      "end": 261.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there was no light seen;",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 261.334,
      "end": 266.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was great mourning and howling and weeping among all the people continually;",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 266.437,
      "end": 274.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, great were the groanings of the people, because of the darkness and the great destruction which had come upon them.",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 275.43,
      "end": 278.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in one place they were heard to cry, saying:",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 278.396,
      "end": 281.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that we had repented before this great and terrible day,",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 282.059,
      "end": 284.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then would our brethren have been spared,",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 284.654,
      "end": 288.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would not have been burned in that great city Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 288.91,
      "end": 292.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in another place they were heard to cry and mourn, saying:",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 292.852,
      "end": 296.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that we had repented before this great and terrible day,",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 296.515,
      "end": 297.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had not killed",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 298.042,
      "end": 299.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stoned the prophets,",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 299.987,
      "end": 301.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cast them out;",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 301.7,
      "end": 304.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then would our mothers and our fair daughters,",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 304.899,
      "end": 306.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our children have been spared,",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 306.983,
      "end": 310.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not have been buried up in that great city Moronihah.",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 310.739,
      "end": 313.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus were the howlings of the people great and terrible.",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 87
    }
  ]
}